{"schema_version":1,"key":"p08-explicit-naming-request|control|1","case_id":"p08-explicit-naming-request","type":"naming","condition":"control","repetition":1,"status":"success","output":"- **AI待ち間（ま）埋め** — AIの処理待ちを別の仕事で埋め、結局休めなくなる状態。\n- **待機間ワーク** — 待ち時間を仕事に転換し続け、空き時間が消えていく働き方。\n- **余白蒸発シンドローム** — AIで生まれるはずだった余白が、別タスクによって蒸発する現象。","usage":{"input_tokens":13276,"cached_input_tokens":10624,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":112,"reasoning_output_tokens":0},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T06:31:19.236Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T06:31:25.925Z","duration_ms":6689}
{"schema_version":1,"key":"p08-explicit-naming-request|skill|1","case_id":"p08-explicit-naming-request","type":"naming","condition":"skill","repetition":1,"status":"success","output":"1. **提案名：AI待ち時間の仕事詰め**\n\n   AIが考えている間に別の仕事を入れてしまい、空き時間が消える状態。\n\n2. **提案名：思考待ち埋め**\n\n   AIの思考を待つ時間を別の仕事で埋めた結果、空き時間がなくなる状態。\n\n3. **提案名：AI待機間ワーク**\n\n   AIが考えている最中に別の仕事を始めてしまい、空き時間が消える状態。","usage":{"input_tokens":22060,"cached_input_tokens":10624,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":185,"reasoning_output_tokens":53},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T06:31:20.933Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T06:31:28.532Z","duration_ms":7599}
